  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Tuesday 24 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPicture long summer evenings strolling down to the beach, a quick walk to your favourite café, and the whole family settled in before Christmas. This is the one you’ve been waiting for.\r\n\r\nSet in a relaxed coastal pocket, this four-bedroom home offers the space a growing family needs, without the price tag that usually comes with it. A comfortable lounge gives everyone room to unwind, the bedrooms give everyone room of their own, and the bathroom keeps it all simple and easy to manage.\r\n\r\nLocation is where this home really shines. Waiake Beach is just a short distance away for morning swims and weekend picnics, while Browns Bay Beach and its buzzing shops, cafés and restaurants are right on your doorstep. Everything you need, close to home.\r\n\r\nFor families, the school zoning is a standout. You’re in zone for Glamorgan and Torbay Schools, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College, giving your children a clear path from their first school day right through to graduation.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re stepping onto the property ladder for the first time or looking for room to grow, this home is a smart, exciting start. Move in, kick off your shoes, and enjoy your first summer by the sea.\r\n\r\nBe in for Christmas. Call Bren or Nicole today to arrange your viewing.",
